        {
          "text": "ento wek acibut kacel ki’ kwarina; tiŋa woko ki i Ejipt, ci iciyika i kabedo ma giyikogi iye.” En ogamo ni, “Abitiyo kit ma doŋ iwaco-ni.” ",
